1
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,360
Where am I?

2
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,120
Am I dreaming?

3
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:10,280
Think of it as

4
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:11,760
being transported
to a cultivation world.

5
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,560
This world's supreme ruler, Shenlyu...

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,080
The Yellow Dragon made a prophecy:

7
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,360
only you can save the Xuanji Realm.

8
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,320
(A mortal body, a heaven-burning fate)
Your destiny lies here.

9
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,360
If you let me cultivate with you,

10
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:23,760
I'll fight for you.

11
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:28,440
Kill him!

12
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:29,840
(From Kuaikan Comic's "The Great Queen")
Don't you touch her!

13
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:30,560
(By Ao Xiaoze)
My life

14
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,920
isn't yours to take.

15
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:34,040
=The Great Queen=

16
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:36,040
(Adapted from Kuaikan Comic's exclusive
series "The Great Queen" by Ao Xiaoze)

17
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:38,400
=Episode 1=

18
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,680
(Huyun Kingdom)

19
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,280
(The Crown Prince's bedchamber really is
hard to sneak into.)

20
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,280
(Huyun Tribute Maiden Chi Yuan)
(Huyun's consort selection nears.)

21
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:48,880
(So many fierce rivals.)

22
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:51,360
(Tonight,
I just need to get to him first.)

23
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:51,960
(Huyun Crown Prince Jin Yunlie)

24
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:54,000
(Once I sleep with the Crown Prince,)

25
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:55,920
(I'll become Crown Princess)

26
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,760
(without lifting a finger.)

27
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:03,200
Your Highness,

28
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:04,520
allow me

29
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:07,760
to serve you tonight.

30
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:09,720
Shall I?

31
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:26,960
What's going on?

32
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,280
What's happened to me?

33
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:28,840
Mom,

34
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,920
(Modern girl Xi Yuan)
I got the job!

35
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:31,280
Ugh, you're so annoying!

36
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,480
You walking disaster!

37
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:33,680
What's the fricking yelling for?

38
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,120
Get the hell out of here!

39
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:58,800
Your Highness, are you injured?

40
00:01:58,840 --> 00:01:59,440
I'm fine.

41
00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:00,440
The assassin got away.

42
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,200
After them.

43
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:02,080
Right away.

44
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:05,400
Your Highness,

45
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:06,840
who is she?

46
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:09,240
I was about to ask you,

47
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,160
Lou Jingou.

48
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:13,840
How did a woman get into my bedchamber?

49
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:14,880
Let me check.

50
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:16,760
She seems to be

51
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,640
a tribute maiden from Jinghua Palace.

52
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:19,720
Her name is

53
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:20,640
Xi Yuan.

54
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,040
Xi Yuan?

55
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:24,640
I think I've seen this maiden before.

56
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:27,520
She always sneaks around watching you.

57
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:29,600
She must be a devoted admirer of yours.

58
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,120
Summon the Spirit Healer.

59
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:31,960
Understood.

60
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,840
(A devoted admirer?)

61
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,880
(Is it that simple?)

62
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,520
(Am I going to die?)

63
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,000
(He can save you.)

64
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:40,840
Who's there?

65
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,600
Who's talking?

66
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,200
Who are you?

67
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,080
(Xuanji Realm Supreme Ruler: Shisi)

68
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:56,040
♪I shut out the world, you're all I see♪

69
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:59,560
♪One glance to last forever,
just you and me♪

70
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:13,720
What's going on?

71
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:14,760
I'm completely healed?

72
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,960
How did you recover so fast?

73
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,960
(Huh? Where'd he go?)

74
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,320
What sorcery is this?

75
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:23,560
Your Highness,

76
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,440
the Spirit Healer is here.

77
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:30,520
Huh?

78
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,000
Your Highness, what...

79
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:36,320
(Everything about this woman seems off.)

80
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,000
Your Highness,

81
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,240
forget the maiden for now.

82
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,960
The Demon Lord's seal is weakening.

83
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,680
His Majesty summons you at once.

84
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:47,680
Father.

85
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,080
(Huyun King: Jin Yunling)
The seal is weakening.

86
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,000
You must hurry.

87
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,240
Whoa!

88
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,560
Where is this?

89
00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:56,880
Am I dreaming?

90
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:07,200
What the hell?

91
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,480
It's you?

92
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:13,480
Did you bring me here?

93
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:14,240
And what happened just now

94
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,440
was your doing too?

95
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,360
Who are you exactly?

96
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,880
Your destiny lies here,

97
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:23,120
so you can't leave.

98
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:25,080
The moment you even think of leaving,

99
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:26,600
you'll suffer the agony of
your soul being torn away.

100
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:37,240
(What's happening?)

101
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:38,600
(Fine, whatever.)

102
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,240
(Even if I go back, I'll...)

103
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,640
I... I won't leave.

104
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:48,680
The pain's gone.

105
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:49,640
Think of it as

106
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:51,320
being transported
to a cultivation world.

107
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,040
This world's supreme ruler, Shenlyu,

108
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:53,920
is a cruel tyrant.

109
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:54,960
He used the Xuanji Jade

110
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:58,760
to spark war among the four kingdoms:
Huangyan, Longyuan, Xuanhan, and Huyun.

111
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:00,440
You must overthrow Shenlyu's rule

112
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,760
and save the Xuanji Realm.

113
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:02,920
You have to succeed.

114
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:03,760
Failure is not an option.

115
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:04,880
Your first mission is

116
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:06,400
to win the Huyun Crown Princess

117
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:07,360
Martial Trial.

118
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,320
Wait!

119
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:09,400
I don't know...

120
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,600
I know you're clueless.

121
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:11,280
So,

122
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:13,360
as your guide in this world,

123
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:14,840
I'll offer a bit of help.

124
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:15,960
I don't...

125
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:17,120
Disobey, and you die.

126
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:17,760
Then pick someone else...

127
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:18,880
No. It has to be you.

128
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:20,920
But if I...

129
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,760
If you fail the mission, you die too.

130
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:26,320
Fine.

131
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:27,440
So tell me,

132
00:05:27,440 --> 00:05:28,240
what do I do right now?

133
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,800
A phone?

134
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,920
Isn't this a cultivation world?

135
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:35,800
Why is there a phone?

136
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,280
What is this?

137
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:41,560
Battle mode?

138
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:43,200
The Huyun tribute maiden selection

139
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:44,320
is decided by Spiritual Power.

140
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,560
You've just arrived in Xuanji Realm.

141
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:47,200
You need someone
to unlock your Spirit Core

142
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:47,800
before you can cultivate.

143
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:48,840
Spirit Core?

144
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:51,400
Is it like unlocking my meridians?

145
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:52,920
Something like that.

146
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:53,800
And...

147
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:58,600
Huh?

148
00:05:59,080 --> 00:05:59,760
Where'd you go?

149
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:01,760
You haven't told me how to use it!

150
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:09,600
So you're Xi Yuan.

151
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:09,960
(Xia Honglian, 19,
daughter of Chancellor Xia Ling)

152
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,240
(Fiery temper, openly obsessed with
Crown Prince Jin Yunlie)

153
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:13,480
(Spiritual Element: Fire)

154
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:15,200
Xia Honglian?

155
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:16,280
Why did you hit me?

156
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:28,280
You can't even handle this much?

157
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:31,560
Seems you need more training.

158
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:32,960
Yes,

159
00:06:33,280 --> 00:06:33,880
Father.

160
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:36,320
If you hadn't crawled
into his bed last night

161
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:37,920
and stolen my glory,

162
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:40,320
I would've been the one
who saved the Crown Prince.

163
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,120
I worked so hard to set up
that whole scheme,

164
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,920
and you just swooped in
and reaped the rewards.

165
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,160
Today,

166
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:46,880
you'll pay with your life!

167
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,960
A thousand years ago,

168
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,840
the Huyun Deity defeated him

169
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:55,160
and sealed him beneath our palace.

170
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:56,400
However,

171
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:57,760
human greed, desire,

172
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:59,400
and obsession never end,

173
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,640
so the Demon Lord can never
be truly destroyed.

174
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:04,840
If not for your half-human,
half-demon body,

175
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:06,280
which can absorb Demonic Energy

176
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:07,360
and serve as the seal,

177
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:11,200
the world would've become
a living hell long ago.

178
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:12,520
Yunlie,

179
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:14,880
you are Huyun's hero.

180
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,160
You give me too much credit, Father.

181
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:19,960
As the Crown Prince of Huyun,

182
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:21,320
I must do all I can.

183
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:22,960
Absorbing the Demonic Energy

184
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:24,040
drains your spirit.

185
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,280
Go back and rest now.

186
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:28,520
I take my leave.

187
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,280
(Too slow.)

188
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:33,760
(Still too slow.)

189
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:42,920
Let go!

190
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:43,840
Let me go!

191
00:07:45,080 --> 00:07:45,920
My lady, don't do it!

192
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:46,960
She saved His Highness.

193
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:48,040
If she dies here,

194
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:49,280
you could be held responsible.

195
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:57,160
Since you love crawling into
men's beds so much,

196
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:58,080
then

197
00:07:58,640 --> 00:08:00,080
I'll make sure you get your fill.

198
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,520
What are you doing?

199
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:19,720
(This drug is called Spring Dream.)

200
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,640
(The only way to neutralize it)

201
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,760
(is to sleep with someone.)

202
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:26,320
(I've already prepared it just for you.)

203
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:42,200
Help me.

204
00:08:42,920 --> 00:08:43,960
Please, help me.

205
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:52,360
(Xi Yuan's Sea of Consciousness)

206
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:00,080
You...

207
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:01,920
Your Spirit Core hasn't been unlocked?

208
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:11,880
I feel so hot...

209
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:14,400
I'm burning up...

210
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,120
Help me...

211
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:31,240
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

212
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:38,040
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

213
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:44,840
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

214
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:51,640
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
